<title>THAILAND: Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</title>
<headline>Thai tapioca pellets ship loadings.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following ships were loading or announced at Bangkok port, the Thai tapioca association said.</p>
<p> Departure	    Charter	 Date	  Tonnes</p>
<p> HILAL 2		  (IAT)	 01/01/97     22,000</p>
<p> YICK FAT		 (ACT)	 03/01/97     34,000</p>
<p> IDC 1		    (IAT)	 05/01/97     33,000</p>
<p> SIAM PROSPERITY	(STC)	 06/01/97     40,000</p>
<p>In port</p>
<p> JOHNNY C		(IAT)	  12/01/97     45,000</p>
<p> IVI		     (ACT)	  14/01/97     23,000</p>
<p> SURMENE 4	     (ACT)	  16/01/97     32,000</p>
<p> SOLON OF ATHENE     (STC)	  20/01/97     64,000</p>
<p> ESTABLE		 (ACT)	  23/01/97     40,000</p>
